---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---

<section id="accommodations" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-page">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <p class="text-accent font-serif text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-2">Stay Nearby</p>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl text-heading">Accommodations</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-card rounded-lg shadow-sm p-8 border border-border/20 mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <Icon name="tabler:info-circle" class="w-6 h-6 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-1" />
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-heading mb-2">Hotel Block Coming Soon</h3>
          <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
            We're arranging a hotel block for out-of-town guests. Details including the hotel name, booking link, and
            discount code will be posted here soon. In the meantime, there are plenty of options near the venue.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-card rounded-lg shadow-sm p-6 border border-border/20">
        <Icon name="tabler:building" class="w-8 h-8 text-primary mb-4" />
        <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-heading mb-2">Alternative Lodging</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Airbnb and VRBO options are available in the surrounding area. We'll add specific recommendations once we've
          explored the options.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card rounded-lg shadow-sm p-6 border border-border/20">
        <Icon name="tabler:car" class="w-8 h-8 text-primary mb-4" />
        <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-heading mb-2">Transportation</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We're looking into shuttle options from nearby hotels to the venue. Stay tuned for updates.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
